  "info": {
    "title": "Connectivity and internal app foundation",
    "version": "0.4.0",
    "description": "Feature-disabled local health remains unauthenticated. Vercel and app-enabled local mode require the technical bearer on all non-preflight requests. Opt-in /v1/app operations additionally require a verified current user token. No public bootstrap/password API. FE generated consumer updates and production schema-changing delivery are separately coordinated."
  },
